                "text": "In Henry County, I toured the Henry-Hammond Hospital, visiting their physical therapy and long term care wings. As hospitals in our region continue to face nursing and workforce shortages, I\u2019ll be a voice for rural healthcare needs on the Ways and Means Committee. https://t.co/WpWaBut8Ar",
