                "text": "I traveled up to Jo Daviess County today to visit with Jo-Carroll Energy, who provides electric, gas, and broadband to communities in NW IL. \n\nQuality broadband is critical to the success of families, small business, and healthcare in our rural communities. I appreciate all the hard work Jo-Carroll is doing to expand access to this service.",
