                "text": "As Chairman of @WaysandMeansGOP Subcommittee on Work and Welfare, we have done significant oversight of the unemployment insurance fraud during the Covid-19 pandemic.\n\nThe Pandemic Unemployment Fraud Enforcement Act will help law enforcement agencies continue to recover billions of taxpayer dollars by prosecuting these crimes. We can't allow criminals to go unpunished.",
