                "text": "Last night, I held a telephone town hall to speak directly to constituents in #IL16.\n\nI gave an update on what has been happening in Congress. I emphasized the importance of the One Big Beautiful Bill, Republicans\u2019 efforts to strengthen Medicaid, support for veterans, and the work we are doing to secure our southern border. I also highlighted the constituent services my office can help with. I look forward to the next one!",
